# Distribution Intelligence Tool — MVP to Data Moat

## Overview

**Product:** Paste product URL → get ranked distribution channels + copy-paste outreach scripts.
**Target:** Indie hackers / micro-SaaS builders struggling with "product built, nobody cares" problem.
**Strategy:** infrastructure×code (67% success, n=18) → data_intelligence×data (100% success, n=5) transition.

**Founder constraints:** 15yr dev, $1K capital, 3h/day, VN-based, $1K/mo stable income.

**Kill criteria:** 0 paid users after 45 days from launch → pivot friction or kill product.

## Decision Rationale (from pattern library, 93 cases)

| Factor | Value | Source |
|--------|-------|--------|
| Base rate (infra×code) | 67% success | PAT-CROSS-INFRASTRUCTURE-X-CODE (n=18, confidence 0.76) |
| Founder-crowd alignment | YES (founder IS indie hacker) | Case studies: Plausible, ConvertKit, Bannerbear |
| Platform dependency | ZERO | No API reliance |
| Data compound potential | HIGH | Every analysis → pattern → intelligence |
| Monthly cost | $5-54/mo | Within $1K capital |
| Build time | 30h (~2 weeks at 3h/day) | HTMX + Workers, no SPA overhead |

## Tech Stack

| Component | Choice | Cost/mo |
|-----------|--------|---------|
| Backend | Cloudflare Workers (Hono) | $0-5 |
| Frontend | HTMX + server-rendered HTML | $0 |
| Database | SQLite → Turso | $0-9 |
| AI | OpenAI GPT-4o-mini | $5-20 |
| Scraping | Cheerio + fetch | $0 |
| Payment | Stripe | 2.9% |
| Email | Resend | $0-20 |

