## Kill Criteria (MANDATORY)

| Gate | Condition | Action |
|------|-----------|--------|
| Day 7 | <3/10 DM responses from indie hackers | Pivot friction hypothesis |
| Day 21 | MVP not shippable | Reduce scope, not timeline |
| Day 35 | <50 signups | Interview WHY, adjust positioning |
| **Day 45** | **0 paid users** | **KILL product. Keep channel DB + data as asset** |
| Day 60 | <$500 MRR | Evaluate pivot vs double-down |

